{"4709120": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "METAXIA", "steam_appid": 4709120, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4709120/extras/98e49b3d81e1261b9ba3c498135828df.avif?t=1779315949\" width=780 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Final World War left the Earth in ruins. The flow of time is distorted, physical and digital reality merged into a hazy static. Mutated soldiers, with no flags to fight under, wander the ruins aimlessly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An archivist is sent to investigate the monolithic, spiral-shaped hole where once Hungary stood.  <br>What was the OId World like? Why does reality become more and more distorted as you get closer to the bottom?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who - or what - is Metaxia?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4709120/extras/23de677448f0f11458bcf2acc4f03c02.avif?t=1779315949\" width=780 height=194 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A hostile world</strong><br>Immerse yourself in the confusing, monochromatic world of decay and noise.<br>Avoid or fight various creatures roaming the ruins and corridors. Your rifle uses either your health or your energy as ammo, so approach combat carefully.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolve yourself</strong><br>Find and install new abilities in your hand gadget, upgrade your stats, scavenge for resources.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A phantom of economy</strong><br>The world is dead, but other archivists at the trading outpost will accept your money regardless. Find and buy syringes, upgrade modules, maps and tea, and use them carefully.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Echoes of the past</strong><br>The ruins whisper of history, and an archivist like you can learn a lot about the nature of the world and the few living souls you meet - if you know where to look.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4709120/extras/98e49b3d81e1261b9ba3c498135828df.avif?t=1779315949\" width=780 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Final World War left the Earth in ruins. The flow of time is distorted, physical and digital reality merged into a hazy static. Mutated soldiers, with no flags to fight under, wander the ruins aimlessly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An archivist is sent to investigate the monolithic, spiral-shaped hole where once Hungary stood.  <br>What was the OId World like? Why does reality become more and more distorted as you get closer to the bottom?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who - or what - is Metaxia?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4709120/extras/23de677448f0f11458bcf2acc4f03c02.avif?t=1779315949\" width=780 height=194 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A hostile world</strong><br>Immerse yourself in the confusing, monochromatic world of decay and noise.<br>Avoid or fight various creatures roaming the ruins and corridors. Your rifle uses either your health or your energy as ammo, so approach combat carefully.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolve yourself</strong><br>Find and install new abilities in your hand gadget, upgrade your stats, scavenge for resources.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A phantom of economy</strong><br>The world is dead, but other archivists at the trading outpost will accept your money regardless. Find and buy syringes, upgrade modules, maps and tea, and use them carefully.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Echoes of the past</strong><br>The ruins whisper of history, and an archivist like you can learn a lot about the nature of the world and the few living souls you meet - if you know where to look.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Descend into the monolithic, spiral-shaped hole where Hungary stood. Explore, hide or fight, evolve your body, scavenge the ruins and uncover the mysteries of the Final World War.", "supported_languages": "English, Hungarian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4709120/118abfd807aec5bff89d1f05e67726aff8012ecf/header.jpg?t=1779315949", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4709120/5b63dd11ab4d1413e2556cb13410a7f67f1ce88b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1779315949", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4709120/5b63dd11ab4d1413e2556cb13410a7f67f1ce88b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1779315949", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Win10 or later<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> detailed system requirements will be added later</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": 